      "id": "hackernews-2026-09-14-show-hn-pelican-bicycle-alternatives",
      "title": "Show HN: Pelican-bicycle alternatives",
      "summary": "In November and December 2025, inspired by Simon Willison’s pelican-riding-a-bicycle benchmark, I had some then-current LLMs create SVGs from thirty similar prompts, such as “Generate an SVG of an octopus operating a pipe organ.” Simon mentioned that experiment on his blog [1].\nNine months have passed and much stronger models have been released, so I tried the experiment again today. The linked si",
