    {
      "id": "bbc-2026-09-11-c-line-dion-duets-with-fan-ahead-of-paris-comeback-concert",
      "title": "Céline Dion duets with fan ahead of Paris comeback concert",
      "summary": "The Canadian singer - who was diagnosed with an incurable condition four years ago - has been interacting with fans outside her hotel, ahead of a much-anticipated show on Saturday.",
      "body": "Céline Dion has made a \"childhood dream come true\" for a young fan waiting outside the star's hotel in Paris, ahead of a much-anticipated comeback show on Saturday. The 20-year-old, who goes by the social media name 'Sacha', asked the pop start to duet with him. Initially Céline Dion declined, but then couldn't resist joining in. \"You are such a good singer,\" the Canadian performer exclaimed. Dion - who was diagnosed with an incurable condition four years ago, that affected her singing voice - has regularly interacted with fans lined up outside her hotel. When she announced the tour via an Instagram post in March, she said \"I'm so ready to do this\".Read more: Céline Dion announces comeback shows: 'I'm so ready for this'",
