      "publishedAt": "2026-09-08T20:47:34.000Z",
      "imageUrl": "https://techcrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1794387622.jpg?resize=1200,800",
      "originalUrl": "https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/08/the-exploration-company-nabs-450-million-to-challenge-spacex/",
